   "type": "pub-hero",
   "title": "六种独自休息放松（惬意共处）的方法",
   "texts": [
    "深绿色客厅里摆放着两把贵妃椅。",
    "<p>无论休息时你更喜欢一人独处，还是和最爱的人一起，这些灵活的创意都能帮助你打造理想休闲空间。</p>",
    "六种独自休息放松（惬意共处）的方法",
    "normal"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/6a/ec/6aec70ebf1b3347b36b14b72cd85881f.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/6a/ec/6aec70ebf1b3347b36b14b72cd85881f.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "两张小沙发面对面摆放，其中一张沙发还背靠背摆放了另一张沙发。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "50265111",
    "40274007",
    "70110905"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b1/66/b166b953e424c41e14b8d793cf9dc01d.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b1/66/b166b953e424c41e14b8d793cf9dc01d.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>1.将几张小沙发&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>面对面摆放，沙发中间摆放一张公用桌，打造二人休闲空间。其中一张沙发还背靠背摆放了另一张沙发，一人看电视，一人阅读，互不干扰。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "GIF动图显示天花板挂着的卷帘，可将沙发区和餐桌区隔开。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "20349320",
    "s29193734"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/43/a5/43a5e028d44413fc3bd44b49a36d35c2.gif"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/43/a5/43a5e028d44413fc3bd44b49a36d35c2.gif",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>2.分隔空间。完成你的任务。</strong>即使眼下的任务只是尽可能放松休息，你也该好好完成。在天花板上挂上卷帘，一人看电影，一人安坐桌后，互不干扰。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "蓝色房间里，蓝色小沙发上方挂着凉篷蚊帐。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "60184831",
    "s89129764"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ca/62/ca6277978283e1e82accfa513b725245.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ca/62/ca6277978283e1e82accfa513b725245.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>3.用轻盈的凉篷笼罩你的沙发。</strong>凉篷有个独一无二的功能：它能让房间的整体风格更显柔和，同时又不会带来太过梦幻的感觉。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "一扇房间隔板隔开了两把扶手椅，隔板上摆放着植物、杂志和书。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "50343326"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/08/47/0847da1dd204d459d9907756785d979a.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/08/47/0847da1dd204d459d9907756785d979a.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>4.一扇带有脚轮的房间隔板&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>可以方便你灵活收纳物品，随心选择独处。想见朋友时，只需把它推到墙边即可。它还能为你提供储物空间和悬挂照片、物品的空间。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "动图：从天花板垂到地面的蓝色窗帘笼罩沙发，打造私人空间。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "40351294"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/56/26/56265913403980d93689c961f346cee7.gif"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/56/26/56265913403980d93689c961f346cee7.gif",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>5.在沙发周围添加挂杆和挂帘</strong>，独自窝起，享受极致舒适的私人独处空间。在墙边用直杆挂杆搭配两个转角组合，再在沙发周围添加两个转角组合，并用窗帘笼罩沙发（我们一共用了四个）。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
